  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td> </td> <td>List I (Reaction)</td> <td> </td> <td>List II (Reagent(s))</td> </tr> <tr> <td>(A)</td> <td><img src=\"assets\\qt0044_4c274ad7d3d1.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 184px;\"/></td> <td>(I)</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>(B)</td> <td><img src=\"assets\\qt0044_56832d0ae27d.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 165px;\"/></td> <td>(II)</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext> (i) </mtext><mi>NaOH</mi><mtext> (ii) </mtext><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>Cl</mi></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>(C)</td> <td><img src=\"assets\\qt0044_12a91b7f59db.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 228px;\"/></td> <td>(III)</td> <td> (i)<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>CHCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math><br/>\t\t\t(ii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> (iii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>(D)</td> <td><img src=\"assets\\qt0044_a1474934fc8e.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 164px;\"/></td> <td>(IV)</td> <td> (i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> (ii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br/>\t\t\t(iii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math></td> </tr> </tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
